{"t":"AJG","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance Brokers","employees":69041,"hq":"Rolling Meadows, IL, United States","website":"https://www.ajg.com","summary_en":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co., together with its subsidiaries, provides insurance and reinsurance brokerage, consulting, and third-party property/casualty claims settlement and administration services to entities and individuals worldwide. The company operates in Brokerage and Risk Management segments. Its Brokerage segment offers retail and wholesale insurance and reinsurance brokerage services; assists retail brokers and other non-affiliated brokers in the placement of specialized and hard-to-place insurance; and acts as a brokerage wholesaler, managing general agent, and managing general underwriter for distributing specialized insurance coverages to underwriting enterprises. This segment performs activities, including marketing, underwriting, issuing policies, collecting premiums, appointing and supervising other agents, paying claims, and negotiating reinsurance; and offers services in the areas of insurance and reinsurance placement, risk of loss management, and management of employer sponsored benefit programs. The Risk Management segment provides contract claim settlement and administration services; and claims management, loss control consulting, and insurance property appraisal services. The company offers its services through a network of correspondent brokers and consultants. It serves commercial, industrial, public, religious, and nonprofit entities, as well as underwriting enterprises. The company was founded in 1927 and is headquartered in Rolling Meadows, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co.는 자회사와 함께 전 세계 기업과 개인에게 보험 및 재보험 중개, 컨설팅, 제3자 재산/상해 청구 결제 및 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사는 중개 및 위험 관리 부문을 운영하고 있습니다. 중개 부문은 소매 및 도매 보험과 재보험 중개 서비스를 제공합니다. 전문적이고 배치하기 어려운 보험 배치에 있어 소매 중개인 및 기타 비계열 중개인을 지원합니다. 중개 도매업자, 관리 총대리인, 일반 인수인 관리 역할을 수행하여 전문 보험 보장을 인수 기업에 배포합니다. 이 부문은 마케팅, 보험 인수, 정책 발행, 보험료 징수, 다른 대리인 임명 및 감독, 청구서 지불, 재보험 협상 등의 활동을 수행합니다. 보험 및 재보험 배치, 손실 위험 관리, 고용주 후원 혜택 프로그램 관리 분야의 서비스를 제공합니다. 위험 관리 부문은 계약 청구 해결 및 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 청구 관리, 손실 통제 컨설팅, 보험 자산 평가 서비스 등을 제공합니다. 회사는 특파원 중개인 및 컨설턴트 네트워크를 통해 서비스를 제공합니다. 상업, 산업, 공공, 종교, 비영리 단체는 물론 인수 기업에도 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1927년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 롤링 메도우즈에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":283.63,"mcap":72726986752.0,"pe":43.302288,"fpe":19.146868,"peg":1.0113,"ps":4.612315,"pb":3.0253222,"ev_ebitda":18.115,"div":1.01,"beta":0.464,"hi52":294.53,"lo52":190.75},"fin":{"rev":15768000512.0,"rev_g":0.209,"eps_g":0.49,"gross":0.43956003,"op":0.20605,"net":0.10775,"roe":0.072119996,"fcf":2761325056.0,"cash":1212999936.0,"debt":13489000448.0,"de":56.038,"eps":6.55,"feps":14.81339},"own":{"short":0.0299,"inst":0.98491997,"insider":0.0086199995},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":300.1111,"median":296.5,"high":388.0,"low":253.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":10,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":319.0,"priorPriceTarget":295.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":320.0,"priorPriceTarget":299.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":312.0,"priorPriceTarget":284.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction"